<title>FRANCE: Algerian banks to close on Thursday Moslem holiday.</title>
<headline>Algerian banks to close on Thursday Moslem holiday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algerian banks and other financial services will be closed on Thursday, July 17, the birthday of the Prophet Mohammad, the official Algerian news agency APS said on Sunday.</p>
</text>
